text = "[center]Welcome to SecureComm Industries.

A cyberattack has incapacitated your mentor.
You're now the last line of defense.

Attackers are monitoring ALL network traffic.
Your mission: Encrypt every transmission using
symmetric encryption before sending.

[color=yellow]Remember: The same key encrypts AND decrypts.[/color]
[color=red]If the key is exposed, everything is compromised.[/color]

Good luck, analyst.[/center]"
